WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.666
One document can serve two kinds of
reader.

2
00:00:03.716 --> 00:00:06.107
Start from the how-to template.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.766
In the source, these lines are marked for
administrators only.

4
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:14.153
A general reader's page leaves them out.

5
00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.587
An administrator's page keeps them.

6
00:00:17.637 --> 00:00:21.436
Same source, two pages, no copy to keep in
step.

7
00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:27.782
Publish either page as Markdown, as HTML
for a help center, or as DITA,

8
00:00:27.832 --> 00:00:30.906
where each step gets its own element.

9
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.533
Try it on your own document at
karandeshmukh.dev/workbench.
